{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Kris — The Vessel Theory\n\nDoes Kris control his own body, or is someone else behind the wheel?","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**The SOUL is extracted routinely**\nIn Undertale, extracting a SOUL was an extreme event. With Kris it's routine — right from minute one of Ch.1.","x":-130,"y":-502,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**End of Chapter 1**\nKris rips out his own SOUL and stabs himself with a knife the moment he loses the player's direct control. His expression doesn't match anything you chose.","x":286,"y":-286,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**\"You\" control his decisions**\nThe game treats the player as a narrative entity separate from Kris, not as his inner voice — unlike most RPGs.","x":286,"y":146,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Chara (Undertale)**\nThe main suspect for who \"you\" is: they already starred in a story about controlling a child from outside, in the genocide route.","x":-130,"y":362,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Player**\nThe game itself plays with the idea that the player is the prophesied \"Angel\" — the same question, another angle.","x":-546,"y":146,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei**\nA companion who insists on Kris's role as hero — does he know more than he lets on about who's controlling his friend?","x":-546,"y":-286,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_ch5","type":"text","text":"**Chapter 5 — Weird Route**\nGreenish skin, he resists getting up. Noelle leads him to the lake; they end up submerged. 'Insert Ch.7 Side B'.","x":-900,"y":300,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_hand","type":"text","text":"**The hand theory**\nThe Prophecy's silhouette has no visible arm + sprites where the arm isn't fully drawn.","x":900,"y":300,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_knight","type":"text","text":"**Is Kris the Knight?**\nAt the end of Ch.2 he opens a Dark Fountain by himself, with his own Determination.","x":-900,"y":300,"width":290,"height":165,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-1280,"y":-95,"width":260,"height":158},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_SOUL.png","x":-130,"y":-907,"width":102,"height":189},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_screenshot_kicking_SOUL.png","x":613,"y":-504,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Undertale.png","x":-130,"y":717,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png","x":-873,"y":-504,"width":100,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":-760,"y":-17,"width":260,"height":147},{"id":"s_knight-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/kris_Knight_overworld_knighting.gif","x":-820,"y":634,"width":255,"height":190},{"id":"s_ch5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/kriss_Weird_Route_screenshot_Chapter_5.png","x":-1240,"y":444,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_battle_act.gif","x":360,"y":459,"width":259,"height":160},{"id":"s_jackenstein","type":"text","text":"**Jackenstein (Ch.4)** His fight confirms in-text that Kris's soul and the Player's are two distinct entities — the light that defeats him comes from Kris's soul, not yours.","x":1300,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_islaolvidada","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Isle (Ch.3)** The Seven Flying Aces, copies that Kris colored as a child, say \"the copies are monochrome, but you colored us with care\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] — a direct parallel to the Vessel.","x":1300,"y":150,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_verde_envidia","type":"text","text":"**The symbolism of green: envy toward Asriel?**\nKris's side of the room is empty while Asriel's overflows with trophies and color — the same color contrast repeats in the Green Room in the TV World and elsewhere.","x":-1280,"y":987,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_quien_es_tu","type":"text","text":"**Who is \"you,\" really?**\nThe strongest suspicion points to Chara, or at least a similar force that already starred in a previous story about someone able to control a monster/human child from outside.","x":-940,"y":987,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_jackenstein-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_overworld_Halloween_decoration.png","x":1300,"y":-510,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s_hand-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kriss_hand_acid_river_scene.webp","x":1277,"y":407,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s_islaolvidada-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mancountry_location_Forgotten_Island.png","x":1692,"y":199,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_ch5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_hand","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_hand","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_knight","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_knight","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_ch5-img-e","fromNode":"s_ch5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_knight-img-e","fromNode":"s_knight-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_knight","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_jackenstein","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_jackenstein","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_islaolvidada","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_islaolvidada","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_verde_envidia","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_verde_envidia","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_quien_es_tu","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_quien_es_tu","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_jackenstein-img","fromNode":"s_jackenstein-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_jackenstein","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_hand-img","fromNode":"s_hand-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_hand","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_islaolvidada-img","fromNode":"s_islaolvidada-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_islaolvidada","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_s3_squientu","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_quien_es_tu","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_s2_s4","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_s1_jackenstein","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_jackenstein","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_s0_s1","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_shand_sch5","fromNode":"s_hand","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_verde_ralsei","fromNode":"s_verde_envidia","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_verde_isla","fromNode":"s_verde_envidia","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_islaolvidada","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}